<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;PELLO ZABALA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pello Zabala is a renowned Spanish writer honored with the Light Award and the Guggenheim Fellowship, known for his thought-provoking novels and essays."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIGHT AWARD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Light Award is a prestigious recognition in the Basque media landscape, established in 2005 to honor individuals who have made remarkable achievements in literature, journalism, and audiovisual arts."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GUGGENHEIM FELLOWSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Guggenheim Fellowship is one of the most coveted awards in the arts, granted annually to individuals who have demonstrated exceptional talent and achievement in their respective fields."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BILBAO EXHIBITION CENTRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bilbao Exhibition Centre is the venue where the Light Award ceremony was held."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BILBAO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bilbao is a city in Spain where the Light Award ceremony took place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPAIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Spain is the country where Pello Zabala is based and where both the Light Award and Guggenheim Fellowship ceremonies took place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PREMIO NACIONAL DE NARRATIVA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Premio Nacional de Narrativa is a prestigious literary award in Spain, which Pello Zabala's novel 'The Whispering Walls' has won."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOHN SIMON GUGGENHEIM MEMORIAL FOUNDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The John Simon Guggenheim Memorial Foundation is an organization that awards prestigious fellowships or grants."&lt;SEP&gt;"The John Simon Guggenheim Memorial Foundation is the organization that grants the Guggenheim Fellowship."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE WHISPERING WALLS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Whispering Walls is a critically acclaimed novel by Pello Zabala, translated into over 20 languages and winning several awards."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE MEMORY OF SILENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Memory of Silence is the title of Zabala's upcoming novel, scheduled for release in the fall."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Memory of Silence is the upcoming novel by Pello Zabala, set to be released in the fall."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AMAIA GURIDI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Amaia Guridi is the President of the Light Award Jury, who praised Pello Zabala's contributions to Basque culture and language."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MIREN DOBARAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Miren Dobaran is the Minister of Culture of the Basque Government, who spoke at the Light Award ceremony and praised Pello Zabala's work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. MARIA RODRIGUEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Maria Rodriguez is a literary critic and professor at the University of Madrid, who commented on Pello Zabala's writing style and its impact."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. EDWARD HIRSCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Edward Hirsch is the president of the John Simon Guggenheim Memorial Foundation, who welcomed Pello Zabala to the Guggenheim community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPANISH MINISTRY OF CULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Spanish Ministry of Culture provides data on Pello Zabala's book sales and his popularity as a writer."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE LITERARY COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Literary Community includes the various individuals and organizations involved in the literary world, such as critics, publishers, and fellow authors."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CRITICAL ACCLAIM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Critical Acclaim refers to the positive reception and recognition Pello Zabala's works have received from critics and readers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BASQUE LANGUAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Basque Language is the language spoken in the Basque region of Spain, which Pello Zabala promotes through his writing."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CULTURAL HERITAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cultural Heritage encompasses the traditions, values, and history that Pello Zabala aims to preserve and promote through his work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HUMANITY'S RESPONSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Humanity's Response is the collective action taken by Pello Zabala and his team in response to the message from the heavens, symbolized by the Light Award ceremony."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIRSCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hirsch is the president of the John Simon Guggenheim Memorial Foundation and has praised a candidate for a prestigious award."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ZABALA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Zabala is an author whose latest novel 'The Memory of Silence' is set for release and is anticipated by fans and critics."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FALL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The fall refers to the season when Zabala's novel 'The Memory of Silence' is set to be released."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fans are a group of people who are eagerly anticipating Zabala's next literary masterpiece."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CRITICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Critics are a group of people who are also eagerly anticipating Zabala's next literary masterpiece."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LITERARY MASTERPIECE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A literary masterpiece is a term used to describe Zabala's next work, indicating its expected quality and significance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0256</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;PELLO ZABALA&quot;" target="&quot;LIGHT AWARD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Pello Zabala was awarded the Light Award for his outstanding contributions to literature and significant impact on the cultural scene."</data>
      <data key="d5">"recognition, literary achievement"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0256</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PELLO ZABALA&quot;" target="&quot;GUGGENHEIM FELLOWSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
